# text_en = Most students at Herat University have been forced to identify themselves as Tajiks. Within the dormitory, a campaign of mistreatment and humiliation is ongoing; however, a few Pashtuns managed to secure a place to stay in a single room, which was achieved only by standing in solidarity with one another.
